 "revision_2026-10-20": {
  "date": "2026-10-20",
  "applies_to": "findings on NH3 at 120 min and NH3 at 60 min; the agreement, NO3 180 min and N-basis findings are unchanged",
  "status": "downgraded: cause unresolved and source-dependent",
  "evidence": "The thesis's own Diag 12.1 NH3 rates (katsounaros2009thesis_diag12p1_rates) are central-difference derivatives of the sampled concentrations (mean of the two adjacent interval slopes, one-sided at the ends); the inverse of that scheme reproduces the thesis NO2-, N2 and N2O markers to 0.17-0.19 mM-N RMS. Inverting the NH3 rates gives 3.28, 8.00, 14.85, 20.80, 23.85, 27.13 mM at 30-180 min (sd 0.1-0.3), against thesis Diag 12.3 markers 4.31, 4.79, 15.03, 26.23, 24.27, 27.38 and Daniel's 4.98, 7.64, 13.62, 19.60, 23.59, 27.58. At 120 min the rates give 20.8 (Daniel 19.6; thesis copy about 26, cap midpoint 25.8-25.9); at 60 min 8.0 (Daniel 7.6; thesis copy 4.8). These are the only two points where Daniel departs from the thesis copy, and the rates depart from it at the same two points, in Daniel's direction. Forward check: the NH3 rates miss the thesis markers by up to 0.144 mM/min (78 px, about 50 times the reading error), while NO2- from the same samples matches to 0.0035; replacing only the two thesis values with Daniel's cuts the worst residual to 0.034. The journal Fig. 1 is a re-plot (its curves are model B, not the thesis constants) and was not checked; it may plot NH3 near 8 and 20 mM. The thesis-copy features also lie near the rate-implied values (visible-part midpoint 7.3 at 60 min, triangle base 21.0 at 120 min), so a misclick and a different journal figure cannot be told apart without the journal image.",
  "recommendation": "Do not replace Daniel's NH3 values with the thesis-copy 4.8 and 26.2. Keep them, flag NH3 at 60 and 120 min as source-dependent (+-3 and +-6 mM), and pixel-check Katsounaros 2012 Fig. 1 in the journal PDF.",
  "sources": [
   "data/digitized_inputs/katsounaros2009thesis_diag12p1_intermediates/verification.json (check claim6_NH3_120_and_the_misclick_verdict)",
   "data/digitized_inputs/katsounaros2009thesis_diag12p3_errorbars/verification.json (check NH3_120_thesis_copy)"
  ]
 }
